<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine bolsa approves Perez Companc bonds.</title>
<headline>Argentine bolsa approves Perez Companc bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Buenos Aires Stock Exchange said Thursday it had authorized a $400 million bond issue by industrial holding Perez Companc.</p>
<p>The dollar bonds, due 2007, were issued at 99.918 percent and were part of a $1.2 billion program.  </p>
<p>The bonds will pay a 8.125 percent annual interest rate.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
